=== {{S|étymologie}} ===
: {{laé|en|nom|1}} Du {{étyl|enm|en|bee}} du {{étyl|ang|en|beo|dif=bēo}} du {{étyl|proto-germanique|en}} {{recons|lang-mot-vedette=en|bion}} de l’{{étyl|indo-européen commun|en}} {{recons|lang-mot-vedette=en|bʰey-}}.
: {{laé|en|nom|2}} Du {{étyl|ang|en|ben|dif=bēn}}.
: {{laé|en|nom|3}} Du {{étyl|la|en|be|dif=bē}}.

==== {{S|attestations}} ====
* {{exemple|lang=ang|tête=*
 |Þa hi me ymbsealdon samod anlice swa '''beon''' bitere, oððe þu bærne eac þornas þyre þicce fyre, þær me nama dryhtnes      neode scylde.
 |
 |source=The Paris Psalter: Psalm 117, 12, c. 1025-1050, f° 138r
 |lien=https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/btv1b8451636f/f285.item.zoom}}

=== {{S|nom|en|num=1}} ===
{{en-nom-rég|ˈbi|ˈbiː}}
[[Image:Drinking Bee.jpg|thumb|right|Une abeille ({{Lang|en|'''bee'''}}).]]
'''bee''' {{pron|ˈbi|en}} {{US|nocat=1}}, {{pron|ˈbiː|en}} {{UK|nocat=1}}
# [[abeille|Abeille]], [[insecte]] [[social]] et [[domestiqué]] pour la fabrication du [[miel]] et de la [[cire d’abeille]]. 
#* {{exemple|According to all known laws of aviation, there is no way that a '''bee''' should be able to fly. Its wings are too small to get its fat little body off the ground. The '''bee''', of course, flies anyway. Because '''bees''' don't care what humans think is impossible.|source=DreamWorks Animation, Columbus 81 Productions, ''{{W|Bee Movie}}'', Paramount Pictures, 2007|lien=https://en.wikiquote.org/wiki/Bee_Movie|lang=en}}
# {{par extension|en}} Insecte [[mellifère]] de la famille des [[aculéate]]s.
#* {{exemple|lang=en}}

